  "reglages.comptes.instagram_note": {"fr": "Publication automatique des Reels, envoyés depuis le PC (aucun hébergement). Compte professionnel requis ; jeton de Page (EAA…) ou jeton Instagram (IG…). 100 posts / 24 h glissantes.", "en": "Auto-publishes Reels, uploaded from the PC (no hosting). Business account required; Page token (EAA…) or Instagram token (IG…). 100 posts per rolling 24 h."},
